1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,410
This video was made by democut.

2
00:00:02,410 --> 00:00:07,277
Your coding agent records the app, and democut turns it into a narrated demo.

3
00:00:08,717 --> 00:00:11,863
Every click gets a ripple and a short pause before it,

4
00:00:11,863 --> 00:00:14,135
so nobody loses track of what happened.

5
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:19,125
Page loads are cut out, and slow parts are sped up to

6
00:00:19,125 --> 00:00:22,795
fit the narration. Each shot lasts as long as its voiceover.

7
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:27,915
Email addresses and other private text are masked before the page is

8
00:00:27,915 --> 00:00:30,170
painted, so they never reach the video.

9
00:00:31,383 --> 00:00:34,003
From one storyboard you get a full cut,

10
00:00:34,003 --> 00:00:37,026
a short cut, captions, a GIF for your readme,

11
00:00:37,026 --> 00:00:39,175
and a player page with chapters.

12
00:00:39,175 --> 00:00:40,451
It is MIT licensed.

13
00:00:40,451 --> 00:00:43,138
Install it in Claude Code with one line.

